@host = http://localhost:5199
@token = paste-an-entra-id-jwt-here

### OpenAPI document (anonymous in Development)
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json

### Health check (anonymous)
GET {{host}}/health

### List distributors (requires bearer token)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/distributors?page=1&pageSize=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get one
GET {{host}}/api/v1/distributors/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create
POST {{host}}/api/v1/distributors
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Acme Connectors",
  "region": "APAC",
  "isActive": true
}
